  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Behavior Observation Console",
    "overview": "CYBERVEIL is an Operate-mode native desktop console. The incumbent world is a deep navy working field with teal instrumentation, pale readable text, fine borders, and restrained luminous atmosphere. Its radar, shield/circuit vocabulary, and quiet line icons make observation the focal task. This record extends that established world; it does not establish a new aesthetic.\n\nState and evidence take priority over decoration. English and Arabic share the same screen family, with Qt layout direction handling right-to-left presentation. The adjacent sandbox-report action inherits the existing secondary control treatment and keeps recorded evidence distinct from local observation.",
